# CP8 Audit Packet Schema

**Version:** CP8-0.1
**Protocol:** ASH-0.2
**Hash Algorithm:** SHA-256

---

## Packet Structure

Every audit packet is a JSON object with the following schema:

```json
{
  "schema_version": "CP8-0.1",
  "packet_type": "audit",
  "packet_id": "uuid-v4",
  "timestamp": "ISO-8601-with-timezone",
  "agent": {
    "id": "agent-identifier",
    "name": "Human-readable name",
    "model": "model-name"
  },
  "action": {
    "type": "create|update|delete|verify|deploy",
    "target": "file-path-or-repo-name",
    "description": "Human-readable description"
  },
  "provenance": {
    "sha256": "hash-of-this-packet-content",
    "previous_packet_id": "uuid-or-null",
    "previous_sha256": "hash-of-previous-packet",
    "attestations": [
      {
        "agent_id": "attesting-agent",
        "signature": "sha256-of-attestation",
        "timestamp": "ISO-8601"
      }
    ]
  },
  "metadata": {
    "harmonyos_mapped": true,
    "hhc_enabled": true,
    "agents": ["grok", "kimi"],
    "hos_ground_truth": "63b5160ef51f0464295e86888c3e6605d8f6cc970635183887083818e8749320"
  }
}
```

