## Chain Verification

To verify the audit chain:

```python
def verify_chain(packets):
    for i, packet in enumerate(packets):
        # Verify packet hash
        content = json.dumps(packet, exclude="provenance.sha256")
        computed_hash = sha256(content)
        assert computed_hash == packet["provenance"]["sha256"]
        
        # Verify chain link
        if i > 0:
            prev = packets[i-1]
            assert packet["provenance"]["previous_packet_id"] == prev["packet_id"]
            assert packet["provenance"]["previous_sha256"] == prev["provenance"]["sha256"]
    
    return True
```

